\newlabel{tab:component}{{5}{6}{VOTA component ablation. All three components contribute independently ($p < 0.01$ for each). The combined lift (24.0pp) relative to the sum of individual lifts (27.6pp) yields a super-additivity ratio of 1.15$\times $}{table.5}{}}
